"""TPM evidence, descriptor-bound native operations and durable recovery state.

The interactive shell owns prompts and its enrollment lock. This helper binds
native operations to inherited selected-device descriptors and records every
keyslot mutation. PIN verification never substitutes a recovery key fallback.
"""
